# SASS Style Guide - Strata Reserve Planning

**Quick Reference for Component & Page Styling**

---

### 1. One Component = One SASS File
```
ProfileCard.tsx  →  ProfileCard.scss
ReserveFund.tsx  →  ReserveFund.scss
```

### 2. Unique Component Namespace
Every component gets a **unique root class name** to prevent conflicts:

```scss
// EXAMPLES OF GOOD - Each component has unique namespace
// ProfileCard.scss
.profile-card { }

// ReserveFundCard.scss
.reserve-fund-card { }

// EXAMPLES OF BAD  - Shared names!
// Both files using .card will override each other
.card { }
```

### 3. BEM Naming Pattern
```
.component-name                    // Block (root)
.component-name__element          // Element (child) - use __
.component-name--modifier         // Modifier (variant) - use --
.component-name__element--modifier // Combined
```

