## SASS File Template

```scss
// 1. IMPORTS (always first)
@use '../variables' as *;
@use '../mixins' as *;

// 2. UNIQUE ROOT CLASS (matches component name)
.unique-component-name {
  // Base styles (mobile-first)
  padding: $spacing-md;
  background-color: $color-background;
  border: 1px solid $color-border-light;
  border-radius: $border-radius-md;
  
  // 3. MODIFIERS (variants, sizes, states)
  &--primary {
    background-color: $color-primary;
    color: $color-text-white;
  }
  
  &--large {
    padding: $spacing-lg;
    font-size: $font-size-lg;
  }
  
  &--disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  
  // 4. INTERACTIVE STATES
  &--clickable {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: $transition-base;
    
    &:hover:not(&--disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: $shadow-md;
    }
  }
  
  // 5. CHILD ELEMENTS (using __ syntax)
  &__header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: $spacing-sm;
    border-bottom: 1px solid $color-border-light;
  }
  
  &__title {
    font-size: $font-size-lg;
    font-weight: $font-weight-bold;
    color: $color-text-primary;
  }
  
  &__body {
    padding: $spacing-md 0;
  }
  
  &__footer {
    display: flex;
    gap: $spacing-sm;
    padding-top: $spacing-sm;
  }
  
  // 6. NESTED MODIFIERS
  &__button {
    padding: $spacing-sm $spacing-md;
    border-radius: $border-radius-sm;
    transition: $transition-base;
    
    &--primary {
      background-color: $color-primary;
      color: $color-text-white;
      
      &:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background-color: $color-primary-hover;
      }
    }
    
    &--secondary {
      background-color: transparent;
      border: 1px solid $color-border-medium;
      
      &:hover:not(:disabled) {
        background-color: $color-background-light;
      }
    }
    
    &:disabled {
      opacity: 0.5;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }
  }
}

// 7. RESPONSIVE (use mixins, NOT raw media queries)
@include respond-below(md) {
  // Mobile only (below 768px)
  .unique-component-name {
    padding: $spacing-sm;
    
    &__footer {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
}

@include respond-to(md) {
  // Tablet and up (768px+)
  .unique-component-name {
    padding: $spacing-lg;
  }
}

@include respond-to(lg) {
  // Desktop and up (992px+)
  .unique-component-name {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
}
```

