## Color Usage

### Primary Actions (Greens)
Use for main actions, success states:
```scss
.save-button {
  background-color: $color-primary;        // #6B8E5F
  color: $color-text-white;
  
  &:hover {
    background-color: $color-primary-hover; // #55724c
  }
}
```

### Secondary Actions (Blues)
Use for navigation, links, secondary buttons:
```scss
.cancel-button {
  background-color: $color-secondary;      // #155DFC
  color: $color-text-white;
  
  &:hover {
    background-color: $color-primary-dark;
  }
}
```

### Error/Destructive (Reds)
Use for delete, errors, warnings:
```scss
.delete-button {
  background-color: $color-error;          // #FF0000
  color: $color-text-white;
  
  &:hover {
    background-color: $color-error-dark;
  }
}
```

### Status Messages
```scss
.success-message {
  background-color: $color-primary-lightest;
  border-left: 4px solid $color-success;
}

.error-message {
  background-color: lighten($color-error, 45%);
  border-left: 4px solid $color-error;
}

.warning-message {
  background-color: $color-accent-yellow-light;
  border-left: 4px solid $color-warning;
}
```

