## Responsive Design (3 Breakpoints)

**Mobile:** 320px - 767px (default, no mixin)  
**Tablet:** 768px - 991px  
**Desktop:** 992px+

### Mobile First 
```scss
.component {
  // Mobile styles (default)
  padding: $spacing-sm;
  font-size: $font-size-sm;
  
  // Tablet and up
  @include respond-to(md) {
    padding: $spacing-md;
    font-size: $font-size-body;
  }
  
  // Desktop and up
  @include respond-to(lg) {
    padding: $spacing-lg;
    font-size: $font-size-lg;
  }
}
```


## React Integration

### className Construction

**Static class:**
```tsx
<div className="profile-card">
```

**With modifier:**
```tsx
<div className={`profile-card profile-card--${variant}`}>
```

**Conditional classes:**
```tsx
<div className={`profile-card ${isActive ? 'profile-card--active' : ''}`}>
```

**Multiple conditions:**
```tsx
<button 
  className={`
    reserve-button 
    reserve-button--${size}
    ${isDisabled ? 'reserve-button--disabled' : ''}
    ${isLoading ? 'reserve-button--loading' : ''}
  `}
>
```

**Child elements:**
```tsx
<div className="profile-card">
  <div className="profile-card__header">
    <h2 className="profile-card__title">Title</h2>
  </div>
  <div className="profile-card__body">
    Content
  </div>
</div>
```

