## Must-Use Variables

## Checklist for New Components

- [ ] **Created dedicated SASS file** next to component
- [ ] **Used unique root class name** (no conflicts)
- [ ] Used kebab-case: `reserve-fund-card` not `reserveFundCard`
- [ ] Imported: `@use '../variables' as *;`
- [ ] Imported: `@use '../mixins' as *;`
- [ ] Used color variables (no hex values)
- [ ] Used spacing variables (no hardcoded px)
- [ ] Used breakpoint mixins (no raw media queries)
- [ ] Added `:hover` states for interactive elements
- [ ] Added `:disabled` state if applicable
- [ ] Added transitions for smooth interactions
- [ ] Kept nesting shallow (2-3 levels max)
- [ ] Used `box-sizing: border-box`
- [ ] Tested mobile (< 750px)
- [ ] Tested tablet (750px - 1000px)
- [ ] Tested desktop (1000px+)

---

PLEASE NO HARDCODED VALUES!

