## Example

**Component: ReserveFundCard.tsx**
```tsx
export default function ReserveFundCard({ amount, label, variant = 'primary' }) {
  return (
    <div className={`reserve-fund-card reserve-fund-card--${variant}`}>
      <div className="reserve-fund-card__header">
        <h3 className="reserve-fund-card__title">{label}</h3>
      </div>
      <div className="reserve-fund-card__amount">${amount}</div>
      <button className="reserve-fund-card__button">
        View Details
      </button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

